-headline-48617a69 gb-headline-text\"><table border=\"1\" width=\"777\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 240px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 99.6094%; height: 240px;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>NTA – <strong>Council of Scientific &amp; Industrial Research CSIR</strong><br>\n</strong></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"color: #008000;\">NTA CSIR UGC NET Exam June 2026</span></strong></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>NTA CSIR NET June 2026 Exam : Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong></strong></span></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 230px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 49.737%; height: 230px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"325\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Application Begin :<strong> 27/05/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Last Date for Apply Online :<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong> 19/06/2026</strong></span></li>\n<li>Pay Exam Fee Last Date : <strong> 20/06/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Correction Date : <strong>22-23 June 2026</strong></li>\n<li>NTA CSIR Exam Date : <strong>17-18 July 2026</strong></li>\n<li>Answer Key Available :<strong> As per SChedule </strong></li>\n<li>Result Declared : <strong>Notified Soon</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 49.8724%; height: 230px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"313\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>General : <strong>1150/-</strong></li>\n<li>EWS / OBC : <strong>600/-</strong></li>\n<li>ST / SC / PH : <strong>325/-</strong></li>\n<li>Pay the Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI Only.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 108px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 99.6094%; height: 108px;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>CSIR UGC NET June 2026 Exam :&nbsp; <span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">Age Limit</span></b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Maximum Age : <strong>30 Years for JRF Only.</strong></li>\n<li>Maximum Age : No Limit for Lectureship (LS) / Assistant Professor.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 36px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 99.6094%; height: 36px;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>NTA CSIR UGC NET Exam June 2026 Details</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 48px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 24.375%; height: 48px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"155\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Exam Name</b></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.9844%; height: 48px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"220\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>CSIR UGC NET Subject Available</b></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 41.25%; height: 48px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"263\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>NTA CSIR UGC NET Eligibility</b></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 48px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 24.375%; height: 264px;\" rowspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"155\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>NTA CSIR UGC NET Examination June 2026 </b></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.9844%; height: 48px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"220\">\n<p align=\"center\">Chemical Science</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 41.25%; height: 264px;\" rowspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"263\">\n<ul>\n<li>M.Sc / Equivalent Degree with 55% Marks for General / OBC Candidates.</li>\n<li>For SC / ST and PH&nbsp; Candidates : 50% Marks.</li>\n<li>Integrated Course and B.E/ B.Tech / B.Pharma and MBBS Candidates Are Also Eligible for CSIR NET 2024.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 72px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 33.9844%; height: 72px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"220\">\n<p align=\"center\">Earth, Atmospheric, Ocean and Planetary Science</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 48px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 33.9844%; height: 48px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"220\">\n<p align=\"center\">Life Science</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 48px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 33.9844%; height: 48px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"220\">\n<p align=\"center\">Mathematical Science</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 48px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 33.9844%; height: 48px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"220\">\n<p align=\"center\">Physical Science</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 374px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 99.6094%; height: 374px;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>How to Fill NTA CSIR UGC NET June 2026 Online Form</strong></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>National Testing Agency NTA Are Conducted the CSIR UGC NET June 2026&nbsp; Examination and Released the&nbsp; Notification and Invited Online Application Form for the Latest CSIR NET Exam Candidate Can Apply Online for <strong>27/05/2026 to 19/06/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the NTA CSIR UGC NET Examination June 2026 Session Application Form in Sarkari Result Latest Job Section.</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document – Hand Writing, Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – Photo, Sign, ID, Thumb, Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 60px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 99.6094%; height: 60px;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\"><center><br>\n<!-- 300 x 250 mar 23 --><br>\n<br>\n</center><p></p>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full CSIR NET June 2026 Notification Before Apply Online Form.</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 36px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 99.6094%; height: 36px;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 36px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 49.737%; height: 36px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"317\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 49.8724%; height: 36px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"321\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 36px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 99.6094%; height: 36px;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Some Useful Important Links</span></strong></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 36px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 49.737%; height: 36px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"317\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 49.8724%; height: 36px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"321\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><strong><a title=\"Apply Online NTA CSIR NET June 2026 Registration\" href=\"https://examinationservices.nic.in/ExamSys26Part2/Root/Home.aspx?enc=Ei4cajBkK1gZSfgr53ImFTqGsyg38PlGNCGSuvSzsiVbovgbG6pVEHea7DNFe38E\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 36px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 49.737%; height: 36px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"317\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 49.8724%; height: 36px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"321\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><strong><a title=\"Download CSIR NET June 2026 Notification\" href=\"https://cdnbbsr.s3waas.gov.in/s3efdf562ce2fb0ad460fd8e9d33e57f57/uploads/2026/05/202605271224945892.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 108px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 49.737%; height: 108px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"317\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>Download CSIR UGC NET Syllabus</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 49.8724%; height: 108px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"321\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"> &nbsp;|  |  |  &nbsp;| </h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 84px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 49.737%; height: 84px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"317\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008080;\"><strong>Remove Background, Image Resizer, Resume Maker, JPG to PDF and More Tools<br>\n</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 49.8724%; height: 84px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"321\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><strong></strong></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 36px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 49.737%; height: 36px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"317\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 49.8724%; height: 36px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"321\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 36px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 49.737%; height: 36px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"317\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 49.8724%; height: 36px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"321\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><strong><a title=\"NTA CSIR NET Official Website 2024\" href=\"https://csirnet.nta.nic.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">NTA CSIR NET Official Website</a></strong></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6da1cb96\">\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-325acb59\"><span class=\"gb-icon\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" role=\"img\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.5